OL,3,AMeta hooked children on Facebook and
OL,4,AInstagram, US court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta's representative said just over
OL,7,F100,000 such users were found, and
OL,8,Fargued that social media addiction does
OL,9,Fnot exist.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
